class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a8aeae215f43282\" href=\"?note=2a8aeae215f43282\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ReplacementGraphCode}_S\\subseteq V^{12}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ReplacementGraphCode}_S\\subseteq V^{12}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}replacement\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ReplacementGraphCode}_S\n(G,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S\n(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\nG=\\bigl\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in A\\times B\\mid\n\\langle\\varphi,s[z\\mapsto p][x\\mapsto a][y\\mapsto b]\\rangle\n\\in\\mathcal R\\bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}replacement\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ReplacementGraphCode}_S\n(G,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S\n(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\nG=\\bigl\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in A\\times B\\mid\n\\langle\\varphi,s[z\\mapsto p][x\\mapsto a][y\\mapsto b]\\rangle\n\\in\\mathcal R\\bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph reuses the same signature, structure, satisfaction relation, valuation, variable codes, and assignment as the replacement instance; it therefore records exactly the functional pairs licensed by that instance.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a8aeae215f43282","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a8aeae215f43282","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S$ has the explicit twelve-place interface from [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,A,\\varphi,p,\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ReplacementGraphCode}_S\\subseteq V^{12}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}replacement\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ReplacementGraphCode}_S\n(G,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S\n(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\nG=\\bigl\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in A\\times B\\mid\n\\langle\\varphi,s[z\\mapsto p][x\\mapsto a][y\\mapsto b]\\rangle\n\\in\\mathcal R\\bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1561,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3414","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-set11-replacement-graph-code.md|58-df-zfc-set11-replacement-graph-code]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2a8aeae215f43282"]}